WEBVTT

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:15.760
Don't miss that brightly shining light!

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:20.870
It's always there beside you.

00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:26.420
I'm sure the rest just depends on your perception.

00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:31.590
You don't have to search for it—just notice that it's there!

00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:37.350
There's a tenderness that lies hidden behind the most common things:

00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:43.230
a light that showers our days in color!

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:49.230
Tiny Days: This world is constructed...

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:54.800
Tiny Days: ...by fragments of miracles!

00:00:54.800 --> 00:01:00.180
Things that seemed meaningless

00:01:00.180 --> 00:01:05.730
were actually protecting us, loving us, more than we ever knew.

00:01:05.730 --> 00:01:10.960
Tiny Heart: Our feelings flow forth...

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:16.000
Tiny Heart: ...as we give thanks for everything we've been given.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:21.490
We'll never, ever forget...

00:01:21.490 --> 00:01:27.700
We'll cherish this feeling forevermore!

00:01:31.280 --> 00:01:34.990
Fireworks Festival of Feelings

00:01:37.990 --> 00:01:42.750
The MSG series is here to get your
Frame Arms Girl up to maximum levels!

00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:45.850
MSG has everything from
compact to large-scale weaponry...

00:01:48.260 --> 00:01:48.830
Well then...

00:01:49.280 --> 00:01:50.710
are you ready?

00:01:51.180 --> 00:01:52.670
One, two...!

00:01:55.510 --> 00:01:58.060
What do you think? This is your room.

00:01:58.630 --> 00:02:02.560
We've adorned it with lace ribbon as a welcome present.

00:02:02.560 --> 00:02:05.430
Use it to bind or as an instructional tool, however you like.

00:02:05.760 --> 00:02:07.690
I gave you this safety pin!

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:10.440
And from me, this edge of straw matting!

00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:12.890
This is from me.

00:02:12.890 --> 00:02:17.290
Huh? Isn't that the bear that was in your room because it was kinda spartan?

00:02:17.290 --> 00:02:20.290
Yes. But, sure enough, it doesn't match the décor.

00:02:20.290 --> 00:02:23.420
What's wrong with you all?! These things are useless!

00:02:23.420 --> 00:02:25.410
Here. This is from me!

00:02:28.590 --> 00:02:29.960
What's that?

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:32.050
It's an all-purpose storage shelf!

00:02:32.050 --> 00:02:37.890
It's one thing to show off your DIY skills, but this "shelf" is hardly useful, is it?

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:41.480
Th-That's not true!
I made this with Architect's image in mind!

00:02:41.480 --> 00:02:44.230
Hmm. And just what image was that?

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:45.950
Uh, well...!

00:02:45.950 --> 00:02:48.320
Ah. What if we do <i>this?</i>

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:55.160
This integrates all of the decorations.

00:02:55.160 --> 00:02:56.940
This is "integrated"?

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:59.910
Gourai, your design sense is a mystery.

00:02:59.910 --> 00:03:01.370
Situation appraised.

00:03:01.370 --> 00:03:04.580
My, my. Finally, a response from Architect.

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:06.920
These living conditions are perfect.

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:08.420
An unexpected comment!

00:03:08.420 --> 00:03:09.920
I'm grateful.

00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:13.750
Um... are you guys done?
With making up Architect's Room?

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:14.680
Yes.

00:03:14.680 --> 00:03:20.050
Well, would you look at something for me?
I think I've put it on right...

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:21.140
Hup!

00:03:26.340 --> 00:03:27.730
A yukata!

00:03:27.730 --> 00:03:29.020
Yes, that's right!

00:03:29.020 --> 00:03:30.220
It looks good on you.

00:03:31.580 --> 00:03:35.530
And? Were you hoping we would spin you out of it?

00:03:35.530 --> 00:03:38.240
No, no! Why would I want something like that?!

00:03:38.240 --> 00:03:41.500
Then shall we punish you by dragging you through town?

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:43.330
For what crime?!

00:03:43.330 --> 00:03:46.630
I mean, no! Today's the fireworks festival.

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:51.900
Fireworks... festival?

00:03:51.900 --> 00:03:55.220
Huh? You don't know what a fireworks festival is?

00:03:55.220 --> 00:03:59.170
I have knowledge of them,
but have never experienced one.

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:03.260
Well, it's not like you're as easily amused as Ao.

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:04.940
"Easily amused"?

00:04:04.940 --> 00:04:08.760
Wait, so none of you guys care about fireworks festivals?!

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:10.840
For real? Even you, Base?

00:04:10.840 --> 00:04:13.220
I thought you'd go crazy for something like this.

00:04:13.220 --> 00:04:14.620
I don't really care.

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:17.910
I mean, I can shoot off even bigger fireworks!

00:04:17.910 --> 00:04:20.280
Uh, those are <i>firearms...</i>

00:04:21.910 --> 00:04:26.030
You're looking forward to this
fireworks festival, aren't you?

00:04:26.030 --> 00:04:27.750
Yes, I am!

00:04:28.420 --> 00:04:30.590
You guys don't even really care?

00:04:30.590 --> 00:04:33.090
I worked hard to put this on!

00:04:33.760 --> 00:04:37.930
Incidentally, Ao, don't tell me that you are wearing underwear.

00:04:37.930 --> 00:04:38.670
What?

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:40.000
Underwear!

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:41.140
A bra...

00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:42.170
...and panties.

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:43.610
I am, as always.

00:04:44.110 --> 00:04:44.570
Shocking!

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:48.490
To properly showcase the yukata, one cannot wear
Western underwear that emphasizes bodily curves!

00:04:48.490 --> 00:04:49.720
Strip them off now!

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:51.900
You must wear that on bare skin!

00:04:51.900 --> 00:04:53.980
Uh, I'm not that passionate about it...

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:57.690
What kind of talk is that from one embarking to where gunpowder shall fly?!

00:04:57.690 --> 00:04:58.200
Uh, I guess gunpowder <i>will</i> fly, but still...

00:04:58.200 --> 00:05:01.530
Don't look down on the battlefield! You'll end up getting hurt!

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:05.780
Scuttle, scuttle, scuttle!

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:10.540
Hyaa!

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:14.870
Shwip!

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:17.880
Jinrai slashed my panties!

00:05:18.260 --> 00:05:19.680
Hold on, Jinrai...?!

00:05:19.680 --> 00:05:20.930
Oh my, oh my.

00:05:20.930 --> 00:05:22.130
Oh dear, oh dear.

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:24.130
What a pleasant development.

00:05:24.130 --> 00:05:25.740
Listen up, troops!

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:30.040
Ao is about to head to the battlefield,
yet she is refusing the proper armaments!

00:05:30.040 --> 00:05:32.440
At this rate, she shall be struck down!

00:05:32.440 --> 00:05:33.440
Huh?

00:05:33.440 --> 00:05:36.730
No, I won't!
A fireworks festival isn't that dangerous!

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:39.400
He who makes light of his situation shall pay the price!

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:44.820
Exactly. Which is why you'll never get good at putting model parts together.

00:05:44.820 --> 00:05:48.950
For Gourai-chan's sake as well,
we shall have to punish you severely.

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:52.460
No, wait! If I do anything now, my panties will...

00:05:53.130 --> 00:05:55.000
Ao! I suggest you hide!

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:56.830
Ao, what should I do?

00:05:56.830 --> 00:05:59.330
Panties! I need some new panties! Panties!

00:05:59.330 --> 00:06:00.460
Understood.

00:06:03.930 --> 00:06:07.040
I swear, Jinrai gets stubborn about the strangest things.

00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:09.400
White and Black are going too far as well, aren't they?

00:06:11.310 --> 00:06:12.150
Ao?

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:14.900
One, two, three, four, parts of Girl!

00:06:18.740 --> 00:06:19.860
Gourai?

00:06:21.070 --> 00:06:21.990
Ao...

00:06:21.990 --> 00:06:24.260
Did you get more panties?

00:06:24.260 --> 00:06:25.660
About that...

00:06:25.660 --> 00:06:27.490
What? What is it?

00:06:30.580 --> 00:06:33.410
Panty acquisition unsuccessful. Complete failure.

00:06:40.510 --> 00:06:43.300
That glue was quite effective.

00:06:43.300 --> 00:06:45.100
It's sealed nice and tight.

00:06:45.100 --> 00:06:48.180
And those sparkly nails make the closet sparkly too!

00:06:48.180 --> 00:06:48.840
Yay, yay!

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:51.480
Now, you shall be unable to wear panties!

00:06:51.480 --> 00:06:53.770
Why do I feel so drained...?

00:06:55.020 --> 00:06:56.040
It's started!

00:06:56.040 --> 00:07:00.060
The fireworks festival... our summer memory!

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:03.060
"Our summer memory"?

00:07:03.610 --> 00:07:05.070
Well, I mean...

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:09.450
We couldn't go to the beach for summer vacation like we'd originally planned...

00:07:10.370 --> 00:07:13.320
and that whole errand thing was a nightmare.

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:18.880
I thought if we all went to the fireworks festival, we could make some great memories together.

00:07:18.880 --> 00:07:19.710
H-How unexpected!

00:07:20.210 --> 00:07:21.540
You have a point.

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:23.720
I'm sorry, Ao.

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:28.680
W-Well, we can still see the fireworks from here. Right?

00:07:28.680 --> 00:07:31.930
Fireworks you watch from inside aren't fireworks at all.

00:07:35.700 --> 00:07:36.490
F.A. Girl!

00:07:36.730 --> 00:07:38.810
Oh. Good evening...

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:42.440
She seems rather dispirited, doesn't she?

00:07:43.780 --> 00:07:45.820
I feel like I've done something wrong...

00:07:45.820 --> 00:07:48.570
Gourai-chan, you've still come out ahead.

00:07:48.570 --> 00:07:56.040
It's as White-oneesama says: we went a little too far in taking Jinrai-chan's words to heart.

00:07:56.040 --> 00:07:59.230
Indeed. Jinrai-chan deceived us.

00:07:59.230 --> 00:08:01.130
It's been a terrible blow to Ao-chan.

00:08:06.430 --> 00:08:08.590
I must make amends!

00:08:08.590 --> 00:08:11.640
Jinrai is trying to commit seppuku!

00:08:11.640 --> 00:08:13.400
Hey! No, you can't!

00:08:13.400 --> 00:08:18.730
Don't be rash! There must be some other way to atone!

00:08:19.360 --> 00:08:20.930
Woo-hoo!

00:08:20.930 --> 00:08:23.600
The building manager gave me these!

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:28.820
Also, just for today, he said I can go up to the roof to watch the fireworks!

00:08:28.820 --> 00:08:29.830
Huh?

00:08:33.620 --> 00:08:34.820
What is this?

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:36.960
Learning Mode: "Udo Yakisoba."

00:08:36.960 --> 00:08:38.910
Data acquisition complete.

00:08:38.910 --> 00:08:44.460
This is a miraculous dish, one that combines yakisoba noodles with the udo root that is a Tokyo specialty.

00:08:45.090 --> 00:08:46.290
Whoa...

00:08:50.390 --> 00:08:52.010
Tamaya!

00:08:52.010 --> 00:08:54.300
Kagiya!

00:08:55.060 --> 00:08:58.260
I had little interest in this "fireworks festival," but...

00:08:58.260 --> 00:09:00.460
They're not dangerous at all, are they?

00:09:00.460 --> 00:09:01.560
They're beautiful.

00:09:01.560 --> 00:09:03.540
Right?

00:09:03.540 --> 00:09:05.350
So these are fireworks...

00:09:05.350 --> 00:09:07.490
Can I tell you something, Gourai?

00:09:07.490 --> 00:09:08.210
Yes.

00:09:08.640 --> 00:09:13.190
When you watch them sparkle and hear how they go boom...

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:18.330
When you catch the faint scent of them on the wind and feel the heat of summer on your skin,

00:09:18.330 --> 00:09:21.940
you'll want to eat some food from the stalls. That's what makes a fireworks festival!

00:09:21.940 --> 00:09:24.630
Fireworks are a feast for all five senses!

00:09:24.630 --> 00:09:32.710
I see. This is what you meant when you said that fireworks seen from inside aren't fireworks at all.

00:09:33.310 --> 00:09:38.640
Oh. But you and the others can't eat food... so I guess it's only four senses.

00:09:43.270 --> 00:09:45.230
No. It's five senses.

00:09:49.610 --> 00:09:52.240
You watch them, hear them...

00:09:54.120 --> 00:09:57.490
...smell them, feel it on your skin...

00:09:58.160 --> 00:10:02.880
It wasn't that long ago that my heart felt heavy seeing how sad you looked...

00:10:02.880 --> 00:10:05.670
but now it's racing with excitement.

00:10:07.300 --> 00:10:08.250
Oh?

00:10:08.560 --> 00:10:12.470
A night of fireworks is
an excitement you feel in your heart.

00:10:13.050 --> 00:10:16.260
Am I properly enjoying this fireworks festival?

00:10:17.060 --> 00:10:18.260
You sure are!

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:19.420
Hmm...

00:10:19.420 --> 00:10:21.980
Ao-chan, you feel it on the skin, do you?

00:10:21.980 --> 00:10:23.260
Huh? Uh, yeah.

00:10:23.260 --> 00:10:26.400
Well, you are wearing one less layer of clothing than usual.

00:10:27.260 --> 00:10:29.560
That would make you <i>feel</i> more, wouldn't it?

00:10:34.570 --> 00:10:36.990
I went outside with no panties on...

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:41.240
Wait, what will I do about tomorrow's panties?!

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:43.380
It's fine to go without, don't you think?

00:10:43.380 --> 00:10:44.240
No, it's not!

00:10:44.240 --> 00:10:48.410
It would make for an unmatched summer memory, don't you think?

00:10:48.410 --> 00:10:50.420
No freaking way!

00:11:04.240 --> 00:11:07.940
Let's Go to School 2
Let's Go to School 2

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:23.000
Is there something special about August 31st?

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:26.200
Why did Ao go to Bukiko's house?

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:31.420
She said something about a "stay-over." Honestly, humans make no sense.

00:11:31.420 --> 00:11:34.630
What's the difference between the 30th and the 31st?

00:11:35.890 --> 00:11:38.730
Ao had a crazy look on her face, huh?

00:11:38.730 --> 00:11:43.140
Still, sometimes it's nice when the master is away.

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:45.270
Shall we be bad girls?

00:11:45.270 --> 00:11:45.280
Drivel.

00:11:45.280 --> 00:11:46.400
Modeling
Drivel.

00:11:46.400 --> 00:11:48.430
We conduct ourselves as always!
Modeling

00:11:48.430 --> 00:11:48.440
Modeling

00:11:57.450 --> 00:11:59.330
Yes, Gourai here!

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:01.580
Go get my homework notebook!

00:12:02.410 --> 00:12:03.540
Ao...?

00:12:03.540 --> 00:12:05.720
Gourai! M-My notebook! For school! School!

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:07.700
Hey, hey. Ao, give me that for a minute.

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:09.750
Hello, Gourai-chan?

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:15.480
It looks like Ao forgot her notebook at school the other day.

00:12:15.480 --> 00:12:19.640
We totally can't get away,
so would you mind going to get it?

00:12:19.890 --> 00:12:19.930
<b>Caution:</b>

00:12:19.930 --> 00:12:22.970
<b>Please ensure proper ventilation when applying paint.</b>

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:26.840
Understood! I'll head to school at once!

00:12:26.840 --> 00:12:27.810
Sweet, thanks!

00:12:29.900 --> 00:12:33.150
Ao is in trouble. We all need to sortie!

00:12:33.150 --> 00:12:33.900
Huh?!

00:12:34.650 --> 00:12:36.910
What's the matter, Stylet?

00:12:36.910 --> 00:12:39.530
I mean, it's school at night, right?

00:12:39.530 --> 00:12:41.280
I-I'd rather not...

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:43.990
What's this, Stylet? Are you afraid?

00:12:43.990 --> 00:12:46.700
N-N-No, not at all!

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:49.490
We shall remain behind.

00:12:49.490 --> 00:12:52.210
Staying up late is bad for one's skin.

00:12:52.210 --> 00:12:54.800
I'll stay here too.

00:12:54.800 --> 00:12:56.380
I'm sleepy.

00:12:57.470 --> 00:13:01.760
Very well. Base, you and the Materia Sisters guard the house.

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:04.430
The rest of us will go to the school.

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:05.980
That includes me?!

00:13:05.980 --> 00:13:09.650
I didn't know it made you that afraid...

00:13:09.650 --> 00:13:12.150
What if you go armed?

00:13:12.150 --> 00:13:14.600
I think that would alleviate some of your fear.

00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:16.860
Wh-Why are you being so concerned?

00:13:16.860 --> 00:13:20.520
I'm not scared at all, but I don't mind putting on some armor.

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:23.540
Still, it's only so I can collect data!

00:13:23.540 --> 00:13:26.750
I see. It's the 13th day of the lunar month, so we're training for night battles?

00:13:26.750 --> 00:13:28.120
I'm eager to start!

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:29.530
Understood.

00:13:34.710 --> 00:13:36.960
Hello! No one saw this coming!

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:39.560
We're the girls who've taken on this role!

00:13:39.560 --> 00:13:41.550
Very well - let's move out!

00:13:44.010 --> 00:13:46.600
See you later.

00:13:58.560 --> 00:14:02.030
Why aren't the lights on?!
Why isn't anybody here?!

00:14:02.030 --> 00:14:03.740
Because it's night.

00:14:03.740 --> 00:14:06.910
Still, they should keep the lights on!
You can have classes at night, right?!

00:14:06.910 --> 00:14:08.040
Stupid humans!

00:14:08.040 --> 00:14:09.870
Calm down, Stylet.

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:13.540
There will be a lot of stairs from here on, so we'll leave Ni-taro here on standby.

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:14.410
Standing by.

00:14:15.710 --> 00:14:16.920
Whoa, whoa!

00:14:17.510 --> 00:14:20.260
Th-Thank you, Architect.

00:14:20.260 --> 00:14:22.000
Merely a normal task.

00:14:22.800 --> 00:14:25.100
What's with you? You're acting strange.

00:14:25.600 --> 00:14:28.350
This armor is a little...

00:14:28.350 --> 00:14:30.350
No, it's nothing. Let's go.

00:14:30.350 --> 00:14:31.140
F.A. Girl!

00:14:36.400 --> 00:14:37.610
An enemy attack?!

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:41.770
It's just water.

00:14:41.770 --> 00:14:45.490
Stylet, Jinrai: There is a problem with your situational awareness.

00:14:45.490 --> 00:14:46.950
Initiate refactoring.

00:14:46.950 --> 00:14:50.220
No, I'm sensing something...

00:14:50.220 --> 00:14:51.240
Is it just my imagination?

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:53.120
It's here!

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:54.830
It's just the wind, Stylet.

00:15:02.220 --> 00:15:05.600
What do we do? What's going on? What is this?!

00:15:07.460 --> 00:15:12.100
I saw on TV recently that holding
someone's hand helps put them at ease.

00:15:12.100 --> 00:15:13.600
Feel free, if you like.

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:15.920
Why would I want to hold <i>your</i> hand?!

00:15:15.920 --> 00:15:20.980
Well, fine. If you're that scared, I guess I can do you this favor.

00:15:22.360 --> 00:15:24.160
Let's start with the second floor.

00:15:34.940 --> 00:15:35.640
Evasive action!

00:15:38.130 --> 00:15:41.460
That could have been bad. Jinrai, thank you.

00:15:41.460 --> 00:15:45.300
I knew I sensed something strange...

00:15:45.300 --> 00:15:49.040
D-Do balls always suddenly come flying out at school?

00:15:49.040 --> 00:15:51.430
Learning Mode: "Poltergeist."

00:15:51.430 --> 00:15:52.520
Data acquisition complete.

00:15:52.520 --> 00:15:52.850
No, you don't have to explain!
Data acquisition complete.

00:15:52.850 --> 00:15:54.500
Minus any physical contact, objects move
No, you don't have to explain!

00:15:54.500 --> 00:15:55.050
Ao is waiting. Let's hurry!
Minus any physical contact, objects move

00:15:55.050 --> 00:15:56.860
and sounds manifest, as do lights and...
Ao is waiting. Let's hurry!

00:15:56.860 --> 00:15:57.810
and sounds manifest, as do lights and...

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:09.150
And now, a scaaary story!

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:14.280
You're losing the ability to concentrate.

00:16:14.870 --> 00:16:17.330
Take a moment to relax,

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:20.840
and then tackle your homework once more!

00:16:20.840 --> 00:16:23.090
Concentration and diffusion -

00:16:23.090 --> 00:16:26.510
that is the scariest story of them all!

00:16:26.510 --> 00:16:28.800
I-It is?!

00:16:36.300 --> 00:16:41.320
This story is a few years old.
There was a Model Club...

00:16:41.320 --> 00:16:43.310
Did you know about this?

00:16:43.310 --> 00:16:45.860
There was just one member, a girl.

00:16:45.860 --> 00:16:49.900
One day, she was in the clubroom working on a model...

00:16:54.910 --> 00:16:56.120
What is this?!

00:16:56.120 --> 00:16:58.530
Is this what's called a supernatural occurrence?

00:16:58.530 --> 00:17:01.450
Analysis malfunction. Stack overflow.

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:07.830
The girl tried to forcibly assemble some parts, and...

00:17:09.840 --> 00:17:10.890
Snap!

00:17:11.510 --> 00:17:16.090
By using too much strength,
she brought a curse upon herself...

00:17:16.090 --> 00:17:20.850
But the true terror was yet to come.

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:28.110
She opened up a hole in the broken part using a 1mm pin vice and inserted a brass wire when...

00:17:28.950 --> 00:17:30.110
Snap.

00:17:30.110 --> 00:17:36.540
A bad feeling came over her,
and when she looked at her hands, she saw...

00:17:36.540 --> 00:17:38.140
she saw...!

00:17:38.140 --> 00:17:46.620
They weren't metal-use nippers at all,
but ultra fine-blade nippers for use with plastic models!

00:17:55.680 --> 00:17:58.090
It's too funny! They're super freaking out!

00:17:58.450 --> 00:18:03.020
Indeed. There's no telling what will happen when you venture outside, is there?

00:18:03.020 --> 00:18:07.780
We're actually helping them out during these unforeseen circumstances.

00:18:07.780 --> 00:18:08.990
Even so...

00:18:09.490 --> 00:18:11.200
Honestly, those girls...

00:18:11.770 --> 00:18:14.660
...they're so cute when they're helpless.

00:18:15.200 --> 00:18:20.080
Ah! The way those nippers are moving is awesome!
Way to go, Materia-oneechans!

00:18:20.080 --> 00:18:21.900
What? Nippers?

00:18:22.960 --> 00:18:24.910
Were those part of the plan?

00:18:28.420 --> 00:18:33.900
Now damaged, the nippers became unusable.

00:18:33.900 --> 00:18:38.050
And once the girl graduated,
the Model Club was disbanded.

00:18:38.600 --> 00:18:45.020
Also... sometime later, the nippers began wandering through the campus each night,

00:18:45.020 --> 00:18:48.060
as if searching for something to cut...

00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:50.070
What is that?!

00:18:50.070 --> 00:18:51.110
They're nippers.

00:18:51.110 --> 00:18:54.900
That's plain to see! I mean that! That!

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:57.950
We've already seen giant protractors and compasses,

00:18:57.950 --> 00:19:00.620
so a pair of glowing nippers might not be that strange.

00:19:00.620 --> 00:19:02.080
Really?

00:19:02.080 --> 00:19:03.950
Buffer overrun!

00:19:05.950 --> 00:19:09.480
I can't find a way to counterattack! Shall we withdraw for now?

00:19:09.480 --> 00:19:11.220
Program is currently under repair.

00:19:11.220 --> 00:19:13.430
I'm out! Leave me out!

00:19:16.850 --> 00:19:18.010
There it is!

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:27.310
Gourai!

00:19:29.060 --> 00:19:30.150
Gourai!

00:19:30.150 --> 00:19:31.580
It's all right. I'm sure we can fix you!

00:19:31.860 --> 00:19:34.990
Gourai's backup data is accessible from the archive.

00:19:35.530 --> 00:19:37.410
No, I'm fine...

00:19:37.410 --> 00:19:40.410
Actually, my shoulder feels more flexible.

00:19:43.120 --> 00:19:45.280
Huh? What is this?

00:19:45.560 --> 00:19:48.480
It's a fragment from one of my parts.

00:19:48.480 --> 00:19:51.000
But where did it come from?

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:52.540
An unfinished gate?

00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:58.050
Those projections on the frame from when the plastic was injected are called gate marks.

00:19:58.050 --> 00:20:01.180
It looks like you didn't properly remove them.

00:20:01.180 --> 00:20:03.050
Bukiko, who are you talking to?

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:07.140
Could these be for the purpose of trimming?

00:20:09.480 --> 00:20:10.830
Oh, that's it!

00:20:10.830 --> 00:20:11.710
F.A. Girl!

00:20:12.180 --> 00:20:14.530
Sure enough, this is Ao's notebook.

00:20:14.530 --> 00:20:15.820
We've found it!

00:20:15.820 --> 00:20:17.460
We did it!

00:20:17.460 --> 00:20:19.920
Wait. What shall we do with these nippers?

00:20:19.920 --> 00:20:21.200
Wanna keep them?

00:20:21.200 --> 00:20:23.900
If we clean this rust off,
we could still use them, right?

00:20:23.900 --> 00:20:24.750
Agreed.

00:20:27.580 --> 00:20:30.630
Looks like this will make another "souvenir" for Ao.

00:20:30.630 --> 00:20:33.050
One, two! One, two! One, two!

00:20:33.050 --> 00:20:35.680
The "cursed nippers." Still...

00:20:40.260 --> 00:20:45.910
if someone would show up and use those nippers properly...

00:20:45.910 --> 00:20:48.900
someone who can cut that which must be cut...

00:20:48.900 --> 00:20:52.890
the pain of that girl's regret may heal.

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:06.540
After this...

00:21:06.540 --> 00:21:08.670
...it's "FULLSCRATCH LOVE."

00:21:10.440 --> 00:21:14.040
They'll soon show up at your door,

00:21:14.040 --> 00:21:19.440
for my special someone, parts of hearts!

00:21:24.080 --> 00:21:29.720
Counting the days I can't see you,

00:21:30.910 --> 00:21:37.170
I want to hear your voice so badly I feel like crying!

00:21:37.170 --> 00:21:40.660
I'm new to this world,

00:21:40.660 --> 00:21:44.130
so I lack the language to describe it.

00:21:44.130 --> 00:21:46.400
To knockoffs, say...

00:21:46.400 --> 00:21:49.850
"No!" Take care to avoid them.

00:21:49.850 --> 00:21:53.370
I want to be be dedicated!

00:21:56.760 --> 00:22:02.070
I want to build it all from nothing!

00:22:02.070 --> 00:22:05.300
We laugh and we fight,

00:22:05.300 --> 00:22:08.910
creating our unique specs!

00:22:08.910 --> 00:22:14.830
By mixing love and hate,

00:22:14.830 --> 00:22:22.900
I want to create more of these funny, carefree days, the parts of Girl!

00:22:40.640 --> 00:22:43.040
Bukiko's Plastic Model Instructional, No. 1!

00:22:43.040 --> 00:22:45.760
First, get a glob of epoxy putty on your fingertip...

00:22:45.760 --> 00:22:46.920
and rub it on the chest! Rub it on the thighs!

00:22:46.920 --> 00:22:47.260
First Tale of the F.A. Girls
Vs. Hresvelgr

00:22:47.260 --> 00:22:50.890
Then rub it on the chest again, thoroughly,
and that'll get the bodyline to where I like it!
Vs. Hresvelgr

00:22:50.890 --> 00:22:54.520
Next time on Frame Arms Girl,
we're gonna have another session, feel me?!

00:22:54.520 --> 00:22:54.940
Vs. Hresvelgr
First Tale of the F.A. Girls
